WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.634 --> 00:00:05.672
&gt;&gt;&gt; MORE TROUBLE TOD FOR NEWLY
ELECTED CONGRESSMAN GEORGE

00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:07.307
SANTOS.
MOMENTS AGO LEADING REPUBLICANS

00:00:07.307 --> 00:00:12.645
BACK HOME, ON LONG ISLAND IN NEW
YORK DEMANDING THE CONGRESSMAN

00:00:12.645 --> 00:00:14.747
RESIGN.
&gt;&gt; GEORGE SANTOS' CAMPAIGN LAST

00:00:14.747 --> 00:00:24.190
YEAR WAS A CAMPAIGN OF DECEIT,
LIES AND FABRICATION.

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:25.558
HE'S DISGRACED THE HOUSE OF
REPRESENTATIVES AND WE DO NOT

00:00:25.558 --> 00:00:27.894
CONSIDER HIM ONE OF OUR
CONGRESSPEOPLE.

00:00:27.894 --> 00:00:31.664
TODAY, ON BEHALF OF THE NASSAU
COUNTY REPUBLICAN COMMITTEE, I'M

00:00:31.664 --> 00:00:35.801
CALLING FOR HIS IMMEDIATE
RESIGNATION.

00:00:35.801 --> 00:00:38.705
&gt;&gt; HERE IN WASHINGTON, AS YOU
CAN SEE, CONGRESSMAN SANTOS

00:00:38.705 --> 00:00:42.108
IMMEDIATELY SWARMED BY REPORTERS
ASKING IF HE WILL QUIT.

00:00:42.108 --> 00:00:47.280
HIS ANSWER, QUOTE, I WILL NOT.
ALSO MOMENTS AGO, HOUSE SPEAKER

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:50.083
KEVIN McCARTHY, OTHER TOP
REPUBLICAN LEADERS, NO ANSWER AT

00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:53.186
ALL TO THAT QUESTION SHOULD
SANTOS RESIGN.

00:00:53.186 --> 00:00:56.589
OUR REPORTERS ARE BACK AT THE
TABLE.

00:00:56.589 --> 00:00:59.092
CARL, YOU'VE BEEN AT THIS A LONG
TIME ON CAPITOL HILL.

00:00:59.092 --> 00:01:01.761
THIS IS A PROBLEM.
THE CYNIC SAYS KEVIN McCARTHY

00:01:01.761 --> 00:01:05.165
DIDN'T DEAL WITH IT BEFORE THE
SPEAKER'S VOTE BECAUSE HE NEEDED

00:01:05.165 --> 00:01:07.133
SANTOS' VOTE.
HE'S SPEAKER NOW.

00:01:07.133 --> 00:01:10.236
WILL HE DEAL WITH THIS OR WILL
HE TELL HIM TO RESIGN?

00:01:10.236 --> 00:01:13.640
THAT'S A RISK OF BEING A
COMPETITIVE DISTRICT.

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:15.942
CONNECTION HAVE A CHANCE TO
NARROW THE REPUBLICAN MAJORITY

00:01:15.942 --> 00:01:18.611
EVEN MORE.
&gt;&gt; I WOULD SAY IT WOULD BE A

00:01:18.611 --> 00:01:21.848
VERY COMPETITIVE DISTRICT IN A
SPECIAL ELECTION IF HE RESIGNS.

00:01:21.848 --> 00:01:24.717
THE REPUBLICANS HAVE SAID
THEY'LL HANDLE THIS INTERNALLY.

00:01:24.717 --> 00:01:27.220
I THINK THAT'S GOING TO BE HARD
TO SUSTAIN WHEN YOU HAVE THE

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:30.356
REPUBLICANS BACK HOME SAYING
YOU'VE GOT TO GO.

00:01:30.356 --> 00:01:34.393
I THINK THEIR WORRY BACK HOME IS
THEY COULD LOSE THIS SEAT

00:01:34.393 --> 00:01:36.863
FOREVER IF THIS IS ALLOWED TO
CONTINUE.

00:01:36.863 --> 00:01:39.599
ALREADY THE DEMOCRATS ARE TAKING
AIM AT THESE REPUBLICANS WHO

00:01:39.599 --> 00:01:46.706
WERE ELECTED IN NEW YORK, GOING
TO FACE A TOUGH TIME IN A

00:01:46.706 --> 00:01:51.911
PRESIDENTIAL YEAR.
HE'S CANNON FODDER AS FAR AS THE

00:01:51.911 --> 00:01:54.614
DEMOCRATS ARE CONCERNED.
I'D SAY THE DEMOCRATS WANT TO

00:01:54.614 --> 00:01:58.651
KEEP HIM AROUND BECAUSE IT'S A
GREAT MESSAGE FOR THEM.

00:01:58.651 --> 00:02:03.623
&gt;&gt; HE'S A POSTER CHILD FOR THIS
IS TODAY'S MODERN REPUBLICAN

00:02:03.623 --> 00:02:08.461
PARTY.
THIS GUY LIED ABOUT JUST ABOUT

00:02:08.461 --> 00:02:11.030
EVERYTHING.
LEADER McCARTHY SUPPORTERS

00:02:11.030 --> 00:02:17.670
SAYING DO NOT PUT THIS MAN ON
ANY COMMITTEES.

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:20.807
&gt;&gt; I DON'T THINK HE SHOULD BE ON
ANY COMMITTEES.

00:02:20.807 --> 00:02:24.477
THAT'S FOR LEADERSHIP TO DECIDE.
&gt;&gt; HE CERTAINLY HASN'T EARNED MY

00:02:24.477 --> 00:02:26.279
TRUST.
WHEN YOU LOOK AT HIS BACKGROUND,

00:02:26.279 --> 00:02:29.949
IF THE KIND OF LIES HE TOLD
DON'T MERIT AN ETHICS

00:02:29.949 --> 00:02:33.653
INVESTIGATION, IT REALLY WILL
MAKE EVERYONE SCRATCH THEIR

00:02:33.653 --> 00:02:35.855
HEADS.
&gt;&gt; AGAIN, KEVIN McCARTHY IS NOW

00:02:35.855 --> 00:02:39.058
THE SPEAKER.
CYNICALLY MAYBE HE NEEDED THAT

00:02:39.058 --> 00:02:42.629
VOTE SO HE LET THIS PLAY OUT
THIS FAR.

00:02:42.629 --> 00:02:44.864
WILL HE LEAVE?
WILL HE MAKE A DECISION?

00:02:44.864 --> 00:02:52.705
AT LEAST ANSWER THE QUESTION,
SORRY, I'M GOING TO POUT HIM ON

00:02:52.705 --> 00:02:54.741
COMMITTEES.
&gt;&gt; THE COMMITTEE QUESTION IS AN

00:02:54.741 --> 00:02:57.844
ENTERING ONE.
AS RELATES TO MR. SANTOS'

00:02:57.844 --> 00:03:01.114
STANDING IN CONGRESS, HE NEEDED
HIS VOTE FOR SPEAKER.

00:03:01.114 --> 00:03:06.085
HE MAY NEED IT AGAIN IN THE
FUTURE.

00:03:06.085 --> 00:03:11.024
KEVIN McCARTHY WITH THE MOTION
TO VACATE MECHANISM WHERE ANY

00:03:11.024 --> 00:03:15.828
ONE PERSON CAN CALL FOR OUSTING.
IT SEEMS WHAT POLICE SAID

00:03:15.828 --> 00:03:19.132
YESTERDAY, THEY'RE HANDLING THE
MATTER INTERNALLY.

00:03:19.132 --> 00:03:21.601
THE FACT THERE ARE
INVESTIGATIONS IN NEW YORK

00:03:21.601 --> 00:03:24.737
STATE, POTENTIAL FEDERAL
INVESTIGATIONS, POW TENL HOUSE

00:03:24.737 --> 00:03:26.939
ETHICS COMMITTEE INVESTIGATION,
WE'LL SEE WHERE THAT GOES.

00:03:26.939 --> 00:03:29.876
I THINK THAT DOES GIVE KEVIN
McCARTHY AN OUTLET TO SAY WE'RE

00:03:29.876 --> 00:03:33.212
GOING TO DEFER TO THESE ON GOING
PROBES.

00:03:33.212 --> 00:03:35.581
OBVIOUSLY THOSE CAN LAST FOR A
VERY LONG TIME.

00:03:35.581 --> 00:03:39.719
GEORGE SANTOS MAY NOT EVEN BE A
MEMBER BY THE TIME THOSE START

00:03:39.719 --> 00:03:42.722
TO GET GOING.
&gt;&gt; MAYBE ONE OF THE EASIEST

00:03:42.722 --> 00:03:47.060
THINGS WOULD BE TO LIMIT HIS
MEMBERSHIP ON COMMITTEES,

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:50.163
PARTICULARLY NATIONAL SECURITY
COMMITTEES WHICH PEOPLE SEEM TO

00:03:50.163 --> 00:03:52.999
BE WANTING TO KEEP HIM AT ARM'S
LENGTH.

00:03:52.999 --> 00:03:55.168
THEY HAVE NO REASON TO TRUST
HIM.

00:03:55.168 --> 00:03:59.005
I THINK IF KEVIN McCARTHY COMES
OUT AND ASKS HIM TO RESIGN, IT

00:03:59.005 --> 00:04:01.307
WOULD BE A SHOCK IN SO MANY
WAYS.

00:04:01.307 --> 00:04:04.210
THE OTHER THING IS WHY WOULD HE
RESIGN?

00:04:04.210 --> 00:04:07.447
IF YOU'RE GEORGE SANTOS, HE'S
GOT A DREAM JOB.

00:04:07.447 --> 00:04:12.652
HE MAKES A GOOD BIT OF MONEY.
HE ESSENTIALLY WON.

00:04:12.652 --> 00:04:15.588
HIS LIES WORKED TO GET HIM THIS
FAR.

00:04:15.588 --> 00:04:17.924
IF HE COMES OUT, SANTOS WOULD
LIKELY IGNORE HIM.

00:04:17.924 --> 00:04:21.127
&gt;&gt; IT'S HARD TO GET A MEMBER OUT
WHO DOESN'T WANT TO LEAVE.

00:04:21.127 --> 00:04:23.596
&gt;&gt; I WAS GOING TO COME BACK TO
THAT.

00:04:23.596 --> 00:04:30.136
I WANT TO READ THIS FROM
MINORITY LEADER HAKEEM JEFFRIES,

00:04:30.136 --> 00:04:34.073
WHEN WILL HOUSE REPUBLICANS
DECIDE IT'S TIME FOR SANTOS TO

00:04:34.073 --> 00:04:37.844
GO?
THEY SEE THIS AS A PIÑATA.

00:04:37.844 --> 00:04:40.579
WHEN YOU WROTE ABOUT THE NEW
RULES SMARTLY, KEVIN McCARTHY

00:04:40.579 --> 00:04:43.015
CAN SAY THIS IS BEING HANDLED
INTERNALLY.

00:04:43.015 --> 00:04:49.054
HE CAN TRY TO STAY -- HAVE THEY
WATERED DOWN THAT PROCESS?

00:04:49.054 --> 00:04:51.624
&gt;&gt; THAT'S NOT EVEN SET UP AND
RUNNING.

00:04:51.624 --> 00:04:56.462
&gt;&gt; AS WE ALL KNOW, THESE ETHICS
INVESTIGATIONS TAKE FOREVER.

00:04:56.462 --> 00:04:58.831
IT EASILY WOULD TAKE THE TWO
FULL YEARS.

00:04:58.831 --> 00:05:06.072
IF HE DOESN'T WANT TO GO,
THERE'S NOT MUCH THEY CAN DO TO

00:05:06.072 --> 00:05:12.712
GET HIM OUT.
THEY NEEDED THOSE VOTES.

00:05:12.712 --> 00:05:14.213
&gt;&gt; THEY NEEDED THOSE VOTES. 

